    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Enter the DISTRICT, where Berlin's music and nightlife scene comes alive. If you're an aspiring DJ or seasoned pro, this is for you. Skip the cue.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/4b0ef1e05f6c2b07a468e72285f7dabd.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/4b0ef1e05f6c2b07a468e72285f7dabd.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/4b0ef1e05f6c2b07a468e72285f7dabd.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You want to DJ in a big club? We get it, so we've built a state of the art virtual environment to make it happen. You can mix from home, and be in the club at the same time thanks to our cross reality technology. Getting your foot in the door has never been this easy.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/6dbf0decc37c610d1f3b4a0ec7b0f0ac.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/6dbf0decc37c610d1f3b4a0ec7b0f0ac.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/6dbf0decc37c610d1f3b4a0ec7b0f0ac.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Managing your music with DISTRICT is simple. Our advanced music management system allows for you to play your own track and catalogue as well as music directly from our partners. You can drag and drop tracks directly from your library on to the decks, as well as sort your collection, allowing you to set whatever mood necessary for your gig.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/0a8a64cd138f6f88bedc1efa637a2dfa.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/0a8a64cd138f6f88bedc1efa637a2dfa.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/0a8a64cd138f6f88bedc1efa637a2dfa.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>DISTRICT VR brings the essence of Berlin\u2019s nightlife scene directly to your headset. Be a part of the energy, lose yourself, and what this place has to offer. Our venues are designed to replicate the iconic look and feel of the city and its clubs. Meaning unlimited good times, every time you log in.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/86f8cb1beb8f6abfbbf690c17cb6dfdf.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/86f8cb1beb8f6abfbbf690c17cb6dfdf.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/86f8cb1beb8f6abfbbf690c17cb6dfdf.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>DISTRICT exists to elevate your DJ skills, and push your sound to a global audience. If you're just starting out, our tutorials will teach you everything you need to know from the ground up. DJing is easy to learn and take a lifetime to master, we have the tools available for any skill level.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/31c76df201c37708a78b45a2bab300c5.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/31c76df201c37708a78b45a2bab300c5.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/31c76df201c37708a78b45a2bab300c5.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Enter the DISTRICT, where Berlin's music and nightlife scene comes alive. If you're an aspiring DJ or seasoned pro, this is for you. Skip the cue.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/4b0ef1e05f6c2b07a468e72285f7dabd.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/4b0ef1e05f6c2b07a468e72285f7dabd.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/4b0ef1e05f6c2b07a468e72285f7dabd.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You want to DJ in a big club? We get it, so we've built a state of the art virtual environment to make it happen. You can mix from home, and be in the club at the same time thanks to our cross reality technology. Getting your foot in the door has never been this easy.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/6dbf0decc37c610d1f3b4a0ec7b0f0ac.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/6dbf0decc37c610d1f3b4a0ec7b0f0ac.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/6dbf0decc37c610d1f3b4a0ec7b0f0ac.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Managing your music with DISTRICT is simple. Our advanced music management system allows for you to play your own track and catalogue as well as music directly from our partners. You can drag and drop tracks directly from your library on to the decks, as well as sort your collection, allowing you to set whatever mood necessary for your gig.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/0a8a64cd138f6f88bedc1efa637a2dfa.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/0a8a64cd138f6f88bedc1efa637a2dfa.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/0a8a64cd138f6f88bedc1efa637a2dfa.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>DISTRICT VR brings the essence of Berlin\u2019s nightlife scene directly to your headset. Be a part of the energy, lose yourself, and what this place has to offer. Our venues are designed to replicate the iconic look and feel of the city and its clubs. Meaning unlimited good times, every time you log in.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/86f8cb1beb8f6abfbbf690c17cb6dfdf.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/86f8cb1beb8f6abfbbf690c17cb6dfdf.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/86f8cb1beb8f6abfbbf690c17cb6dfdf.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>DISTRICT exists to elevate your DJ skills, and push your sound to a global audience. If you're just starting out, our tutorials will teach you everything you need to know from the ground up. DJing is easy to learn and take a lifetime to master, we have the tools available for any skill level.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/31c76df201c37708a78b45a2bab300c5.poster.avif?t=1741083585\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/31c76df201c37708a78b45a2bab300c5.webm?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732650/extras/31c76df201c37708a78b45a2bab300c5.mp4?t=1741083585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
